     A* XDBPRO - options of an XDB connection profile.
     A* POKIND C: keyword added to the connection string of the database
     A* client. POKIND D: setting of the XDB driver itself.
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R XDBPROR                   TEXT('XDB profile option')
     A            PORDB         18A         TEXT('RDB directory entry name')
     A                                      COLHDG('RDB name')
     A            POKEY         20A         TEXT('Keyword')
     A                                      COLHDG('Keyword')
     A            POKIND         1A         TEXT('Kind: C=Connection D=Driver')
     A                                      COLHDG('Kind')
     A            POVAL        200A         TEXT('Value')
     A                                      COLHDG('Value')
     A            POCHGU        10A         TEXT('Changed by')
     A                                      COLHDG('Changed' 'by')
     A            POCHGT          Z         TEXT('Changed at')
     A                                      COLHDG('Changed' 'at')
     A          K PORDB                     
     A          K POKEY                     
